            <li>The cargo is heavy, palletised or container-sized and can plan ahead.</li>
            <li>You can accept the Aarhus/Copenhagen inland leg and its extra fee.</li>
          </ul>
        </Card>
        <Card title="Choose rail when...">
          <ul>
            <li>Copenhagen or Zealand is the destination and stockouts or seasonal windows are the risk.</li>
